      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cross-host observations: operator reads fulfillment HTTP :4312, RabbitMQ management :15629 and proxy administration :8474.\nReturn data: readiness, settings, jobs/attempts, outbox counts, queue measurements and activity. No cross-owner table reads.",
